[00:00.76]1. O Jehovah, you have given us
[00:07.76]a hope that we hold dear.
[00:15.93]It’s a hope we find so thrilling
[00:23.13]we want the world to hear.
[00:31.20]But at times this life’s anxieties
[00:38.20]are the cause of fears within,
[00:46.46]And the hope that burned so brightly
[00:51.09]has suddenly grown dim.
[00:55.73](Chorus)
[01:00.36]You’re our strength, you’re our hope,
[01:04.99]you’re our confidence.
[01:09.63]Whatever we lack, you supply.
[01:16.63]When we preach, when we teach,
[01:20.63]we have confidence
[01:24.63]because it’s on you we rely.
[01:34.68]2. So Jehovah, please instill in us
[01:44.72]a heart that won’t forget,
[01:53.08]For you’ve always been our comfort
[02:00.08]when troubled times we’ve met.
[02:08.54]And these thoughts that lift and strengthen us
[02:15.54]can revive that dying flame,
[02:23.61]For they fill our hearts with courage
[02:30.61]to speak about your name.
[02:38.68](Chorus)
[02:41.35]You’re our strength, you’re our hope,
[02:44.02]you’re our confidence.
[02:46.68]Whatever we lack, you supply.
[02:53.68]When we preach, when we teach,
[02:57.99]we have confidence
[03:02.30]because it’s on you we rely.